        "# Immutable\n",
        "\n",
        "An immutable object's value cannot be changed after creation. For example, strings and tuples are immutable, although a tuple can contain mutable objects.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-immutable)"
      ]
    }
